Honest ceiling (GR-3)
---------------------
This is CHARACTERIZATION over real transport, not certification. Two VMs on ONE
physical host, a PRIVATE host-only network, a DEV CA, the author's OWN scripted
calls. Three domains add breadth of CONTENT over one decision chain whose
security properties are unchanged (the gate/envelope/verifier/target are
byte-identical to every prior proof). The only open road item remains G5: a real
EXTERNAL attacker on a real PUBLIC surface, which is not code.
